# BELLHOP: all fifty stages are sound (rows the right size, one start and
# one exit, one hidden tea spot and one cup on each of the forty regular
# stages and none elsewhere, warps on A-1, A-6, C-7 and D-3 only, a route
# for the demo pilot), every fifth is a crystal room, every tenth a boss,
# each world's in its order. Every regular stage has something that puts
# fuel back (an enemy that gives it, a bubble, a block or a fuel can), and
# every world has fuel cans.
seed 1
game bellhop
wait 20
expect stages_bad == 0
cheat stage 0
wait 2
expect warp_shown == 1
cheat goto 5
wait 2
expect warp_shown == 1
cheat goto 4
wait 2
expect exit_open == 0
expect boss == 0
cheat goto 9
wait 2
expect boss == 1
